LOAD "COM:DUMMY"
 1000 SCREEN 6,4,256:SKCLOSE
 1010 DISPLAY OFF
 1020 DISPLAY ON,4
 1030 LOCATE 18,23
 1040 PRINT "Now Initializing !!"
 1050 '----------------------------------
 1060 'BGM & º³¶µÝ Set
